'''Palace Plaza''' was a wide, exclusively pedestrian avenue located in [[Theed]], the [[capital]] [[city]] of [[Naboo]]'s [[human]] [[Naboo (people)|inhabitants]]. It was the city's main thoroughfare, and stretched from the [[Theed Royal Palace]] to the [[Palace Courtyard]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref>

